            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi definisi fungsi dengan menuliskan tiga parameter: <code>first</code>, <code>second</code>, dan <code>third</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script1.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"show_winners\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, second, third)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;1st: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + first)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2nd: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + second)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;3rd: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + third)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"show_winners(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Max&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;June&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"37\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1st: Max\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2nd: June\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3rd: Alex\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>first, second, third</code>.</p></body></html>"
