            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang salah dengan kode ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_instruction\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(item, quantity)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Mix in \" /><text value=\"{quantity}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" grams of \" /><text value=\"{item}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"get_instruction(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Mix in sugar grams of 100\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Output tidak akan sesuai harapan karena params diteruskan dalam urutan yang salah</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Fungsi tidak boleh memiliki dua parameter</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada, outputnya akan menjadi <code>Mix in 100 grams of sugar</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Output tidak akan sesuai harapan karena params diteruskan dalam urutan yang salah.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pemanggilan mana yang membuat fungsi menampilkan <code>Mix in 100 grams of sugar</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_instruction\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(item, quantity)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Mix in \" /><text value=\"{quantity}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" grams of \" /><text value=\"{item}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"get_instruction(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Mix in sugar grams of 100\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>get_instruction(\"sugar\", 100)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>get_instruction(100, \"sugar\")</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>get_instruction(\"100\", \"sugar\")</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>get_instruction(\"sugar\", 100)</code>.</p></body></html>"
