            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"retrieve_score\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(retrieve_score())\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>200</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>100 + 100</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tidak akan menampilkan apa pun di console</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>200</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengapa konsol menampilkan <code>200</code>, bukan <code>100 + 100</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"retrieve_score\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(retrieve_score())\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Fungsi menghitung penjumlahan, mengembalikan <code>200</code>, lalu <code>print()</code> menampilkannya.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Fungsi mengembalikan karakter <code>100 + 100</code> tanpa menghitungnya.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nilai kembalian tidak dapat digunakan di dalam <code>print()</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Fungsi menghitung penjumlahan, mengembalikan <code>200</code>, lalu <code>print()</code> menampilkannya.</p></body></html>"
